      "explanation": "The goal-to-obligation direction is coherent: treating a follower report as persisted quorum support requires valid history support for that report. depends_all is defensible as a conditional necessary dependency, not as sufficiency or a claim that every commit requires this particular error path. The stored condition limits applicability to successes actually credited. The concrete handoff from success to match remains missing.",
